    "intro_html":  "Kharcho is the soup Georgia built on walnuts. Ground walnuts thicken the broth into something closer to a stew, tomatoes and vinegar keep it sharp, and rice cooked right in the pot makes it a meal instead of a starter. Coriander, cloves, and dill do the rest. Each bowl carries \u003cstrong\u003e38 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e and 562 calories for about \u003cstrong\u003e$3.70\u003c/strong\u003e.",
